<name>Vehicle Surroundings Monitor</name>
<ttl id="1002S_S000E_742B9_T003J" variety="T003J">
<name>Intelligent Parking Assist System</name>
<para id="RM0000030SJ000X" category="C" type-id="8039V" name-id="672FO-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<dtccode>C1656</dtccode>
<dtcname>Ambient Temperature Sensor Invalid</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000030SJ000X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A7H00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>This DTC is output when the television camera controller's self-diagnosis determines that the outside air temperature has temporarily not been calculated in the air conditioning system connected via CAN communication and the outside air temperature signal cannot be received. (Not a malfunction)</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Even if this DTC is detected, IPA controls normally. (Only the estimated distance correction of the ultrasonic sensors based on outside air temperature is controlled using a default temperature. Also, although it is not a malfunction, it is output even when the outside air temperature is temporarily not calculated.)</ptxt>
</atten4>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1656</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Ambient Temperature Sensor Invalid</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Heater &amp; Air Conditioning System</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000030SJ000X_02" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A7I00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>This DTC is output even when the television camera controller temporarily cannot receive the outside air temperature signal.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000030SJ000X_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM0000030SJ000X_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A7J00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the DTCs by following the screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OCQ007X"/>)</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Select "Clear" on the screen to clear the data. </ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Start the engine, leave it for 10 minutes, then recheck the DTCs and proceed as indicated below.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No DTC Output (Normal)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>"C1656" is output</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>"C1656" and "C1652" are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000030SJ000X_03_0002" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000030SJ000X_03_0004" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000030SJ000X_03_0002">
<testtitle>No malfunction (returned to normal)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000030SJ000X_03_0004">
<testtitle>Go to Air Conditioning System<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005KS01AX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
